OL,3,GNEWSAKeaton Slater's family demand
OL,4,Akiller face them at sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of 12-year-old Keaton
OL,7,FSlater, who was killed in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run, say his killer should be
OL,9,Fforced to face them in court when he is
OL,10,Fsentenced for the boy's death.
OL,12,FDolars Aleksanders has admitted causing
OL,13,Fdeath by dangerous driving and is due
OL,14,Fto be sentenced on 13 November.
OL,16,FThe family said that they had been told
OL,17,FAleksanders may not appear in court
OL,18,Fand, despite a change in the law due
OL,19,Fnext year, prisoners cannot currently
OL,20,Fbe compelled to attend.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
